tire system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various attires and hats can be changed, they also have different functions. Update your outfit and catch the fashion of early 18th century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949120/extras/a8369ec5860ffe2df680a3699917d659.avif?t=1755084039\" width=520 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Item transfer system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item Craft System.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect different items on the road and transfer them into valuable resource, like different kinds of bullets or herbs for example. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949120/extras/4f47ce2bfb5b5cb74955e4f042319faa.poster.avif?t=1755084039\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949120/extras/4f47ce2bfb5b5cb74955e4f042319faa.webm?t=1755084039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949120/extras/4f47ce2bfb5b5cb74955e4f042319faa.mp4?t=1755084039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multi-Endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 4 defferent endings. The first time playing takes about 5-10 hours. If you trigger some special endings, it would be much shorter or much longer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949120/extras/efd9951aca378b727ea8f3c7facd8aae